\put(65.424,-94.26001){\fontsize{21.96}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{b}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}Chapter 2 – Literature Review }
\put(65.424,-129.54){\fontsize{15.96}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791} }
\put(65.424,-157.5){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{b}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}2.1 Related Work and State of the Art (Latest Work) }
\put(65.424,-183.42){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}In recent years, researchers and developers have made significant progress }
\put(65.424,-209.46){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}in the field of sign language recognition using computer vision and }
\put(65.424,-235.5){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}machine learning techniques. Earlier systems relied on glove-based }
\put(65.424,-261.57){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}sensors or colored markers to capture hand movements. While these }
\put(65.424,-287.61){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}systems offered some accuracy, they were not comfortable or natural for }
\put(65.424,-313.65){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}users. }
\put(65.424,-339.69){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}With advancements in Artificial Intelligence (AI) and Deep Learning, }
\put(65.424,-365.73){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}vision-based systems using Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs) have }
\put(65.424,-391.77){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}become more accurate and practical. Tools like OpenCV, TensorFlow, and }
\put(65.424,-417.69){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}Mediapipe have enabled real-time gesture recognition without requiring }
