\put(69.624,-100.74){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{b}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}4.1 Overall Description }
\put(69.624,-116.82){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}The Sign Language to Text Language Conversion System is an AI-based real-time }
\put(69.624,-132.9){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}application designed to translate sign language gestures into readable text. It uses }
\put(69.624,-149.1){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}computer vision and machine learning techniques to recognize hand gestures }
\put(69.624,-165.18){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}captured by a webcam and convert them into text on the screen. }
\put(69.624,-181.26){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}The system connects three main components — input (camera), processing (AI }
\put(69.624,-197.34){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}model), and output (text display) — to create a smooth and efficient workflow. }
\put(69.624,-213.42){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}Users can perform hand gestures naturally, and the system automatically detects, }
\put(69.624,-229.5){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}classifies, and displays the meaning in text form. }
\put(69.624,-245.7){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}The overall system ensures real-time gesture detection, high accuracy, and }
\put(69.624,-261.81){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}accessibility, making it useful for communication between hearing-impaired }
\put(69.624,-277.89){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}individuals and those unfamiliar with sign language. It promotes inclusivity while }
\put(69.624,-293.97){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}demonstrating the potential of artificial intelligence in solving real-life problems. }
\put(69.624,-310.05){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791} }
\put(69.624,-326.13){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{b}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}4.1.1 Block Diagram / Proposed System Setup }
\put(69.624,-342.21){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}The proposed system captures hand gestures using a camera, processes them using }
\put(69.624,-358.41){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}machine learning algorithms, and converts them into text that can be viewed }
\put(69.624,-374.49){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}instantly on the interface. }
\put(69.624,-390.57){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}Workflow Steps: }
\put(83.424,-406.65){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}1. Gesture Input: The user performs a sign in front of a webcam. }
\put(83.424,-422.73){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}2. Frame Capture: The camera captures video frames in real time. }
\put(83.424,-438.83){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}3. Feature Extraction: Using Mediapipe, the system detects hand landmarks and }
\put(101.42,-455.03){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}extracts gesture features. }
\put(83.424,-471.11){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}4. Classification: A Convolutional Neural Network (CNN) model classifies the }
\put(101.42,-487.19){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}gesture into a specific alphabet or word. }
\put(83.424,-503.27){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}5. Output Generation: The recognized sign is displayed as text on the screen. }
\put(69.624,-519.35){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}This simple yet powerful system design allows efficient gesture recognition and }
\put(69.624,-535.43){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791}helps users communicate easily without external devices or interpreters. }
\put(69.624,-551.51){\fontsize{14.04}{1}\usefont{T1}{cmr}{m}{n}\selectfont\color{color_29791} }
